  "contentHtml": "<p><br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">안녕하세요.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>Ⅱ. 전기와 자기 단원의 첫 중단원, 1. 전기의 발생 단원 내용을 바탕으로 AI 노래만들기 사이트 suno에서 노래를 만들어 보았습니다.<a href=\"https://suno.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://suno.com/</a></p><p>예전엔 v3이어서 2분 제한이 있었는데 v3.5, v4가 나오면서 더 좋아졌네요!<br><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">가사는&#160;챗GPT&#160;이용해서&#160;초안&#160;만들고&#160;수정해서&#160;썼고,&#160;영상&#160;편집은&#160;vrew&#160;프로그램&#160;이용했습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">수업 시간 중 노래 들으며 빈칸 채우기 활동 했고,</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">김정식 수석님 팁 활용하여 전기의 발생 단원 시작할 때마다 들려주고 있습니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/483011\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencelove.com/483011</a></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">&lt;노래&gt;</span></b></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">가사, 영상 있는 ver(답 맞출 때 보는 용도)</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/f1oxdJJCc-s\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/f1oxdJJCc-s</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f1oxdJJCc-s\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"500\" data-video-height=\"281\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/drcdOz/hyYG4OZvcR/hsR0xEoWkljKRgRxOPos91/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/hsL4s/hyYFBGoERy/uOsTiiURCLhSDaAKPhB7BK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/f1oxdJJCc-s\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">노래만 나오는 ver(빈칸 채울 때 들려주는 용도)</span></p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/QQoNohZXLtQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/QQoNohZXLtQ</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QQoNohZXLtQ\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"500\" data-video-height=\"281\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/tWooL/hyYFyv8MOZ/ARkPnm3yTDfqs2lbnFQKSk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/OpaLX/hyYB9Y0ukj/OeZMcFxFw7iBr0byHuTEY0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"854\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QQoNohZXLtQ\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><b>&lt;학습지&gt;</b></p><p>노래 가사 빈칸 채우기 학습지(빨간 글씨 지우기는 김정식 수석님 매크로 이용 추천드립니다:<a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/2469\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencelove.com/2469</a>)</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/82d432a8d912be167529b70b4f3726c84f35cb37?download\" data-file-name=\"전기의 발생 노래 학습지.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"1667752\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D346%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20250414163644&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F82d432a8d912be167529b70b4f3726c84f35cb37')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">전기의 발생 노래 학습지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.59MB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">+ 태양계-태양과 달의 크기 구하기 노래</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"